# PSR-3a — Public command front doors

## Scope

Expose **twelve** discoverable root commands without:

- merging `verify:fast` / `verify:product` / `verify:full` / adversarial / live smoke;
- renaming required CI check names;
- deleting the broader compatibility alias surface (except two docs-only exact aliases).

Machine map: [`ROOT_COMMAND_FRONT_DOORS.yaml`](../../platform/ROOT_COMMAND_FRONT_DOORS.yaml)  
Human contract: [`ROOT_COMMAND_FRONT_DOORS.mdoc`](../../platform/ROOT_COMMAND_FRONT_DOORS.mdoc)

Analysis trio (≤3 worksheets) remains baseline / classification / remediation.
Front-doors artifacts are the **public contract map**, not a fourth classification worksheet.

## Front doors

`dev` · `build` · `lint` · `typecheck` · `test` · `verify:fast` ·
`verify:product` · `verify:full` · `generate` · `workspace:create` ·
`db:migrate` · `release:verify`

### Side-effect callouts

| Door | Effect |
| --- | --- |
| `db:migrate` | Mutates DB schema via `db:migrate:deploy` |
| `generate` | Rewrites registry-generated sources |
| `release:verify` | Static only (`verify:product`) — not full integrity |

## Net change vs `c2e63013`

| | Count |
| --- | ---: |
| Added | +5 |
| Removed executables | −2 (`contract:test`, `test:contract:foundation`) |
| Net executable | **+3** (307 → 310) |

## Smoke (no heavy gates)

```bash
node -e "const s=require('./package.json').scripts; for (const k of ['dev','build','lint','typecheck','test','verify:fast','verify:product','verify:full','generate','workspace:create','db:migrate','release:verify']) { if (!s[k]) { console.error('missing',k); process.exit(1);} } console.log('front-doors: present');"
pnpm run dev; test $? -eq 1
# resolve-only — do not run verify:full / db:migrate in this smoke:
node -e "const s=require('./package.json').scripts; console.log(s['release:verify'], s.generate, s['db:migrate'], s.typecheck);"
```

## Explicit non-goals

| Deferred | Wave |
| --- | --- |
| Family runners + workflow reuse | PSR-3b |
| Broader alias expiry | PSR-3c |

## Exit gate

| Check | Result |
| --- | --- |
| 12 front-door keys present | required |
| `verify:*` tiers unmerged | required |
| No CI required-name rename | required |
| Net repayment recorded (−2 aliases) | required |
